     <h2>5. Third parties</h2>
-    <p>RoastMate AI integrates no analytics SDK and no advertising SDK. For the Vent / Feral cloud path, the request is proxied through Cloudflare (our Worker host) and forwarded to a third-party LLM inference provider (currently OpenRouter, which passes it to a hosting provider for the selected model). Apple's iCloud (CloudKit) is used automatically whenever you are signed in to iCloud, to sync your data to your own private iCloud database (see section 3). No other third parties are involved.</p>
+    <p>RoastMate AI integrates no analytics SDK and no advertising SDK. For the cloud paths (Vent / Feral and, in the Simplified Chinese app, the Roommate group), the request is proxied through Cloudflare (our Worker host) and forwarded to a third-party LLM inference provider (currently OpenRouter, which passes it to a hosting provider for the selected model). The Worker's operational logs, which contain no text and no identifiers (see 1a), go to Datadog. Apple's iCloud (CloudKit) is used automatically whenever you are signed in to iCloud, to sync your data to your own private iCloud database (see section 3). No other third parties are involved.</p>
 
